      "source": "Report a startup failure to the user.",
      "translation": "向用户报告启动失败。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Callback interface used to support custom reporting of <a href=\"SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a>\nstartup errors. <a href=\"SpringBootExceptionReporter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>reporters</code></a> are loaded through the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> and must declare a public constructor with a single\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ConfigurableApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ConfigurableApplicationContext</code></a> parameter.",
      "translation": "用于支持自定义报告 <a href=\"SpringApplication.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot\"><code>SpringApplication</code></a> 启动错误的回调接口。<a href=\"SpringBootExceptionReporter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot\"><code>reporters</code></a> 通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>SpringFactoriesLoader</code></a> 加载，并且必须声明一个带有单个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ConfigurableApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ConfigurableApplicationContext</code></a> 参数的公共构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if the failure was reported or <code>false</code> if default\nreporting should occur.",
      "translation": "如果已报告失败则为 <code>true</code>，否则应发生默认报告则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 2
